@startuml
title 结构正确之后还要做语义归一与状态校验

skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam defaultFontName "PingFang SC"
skinparam defaultFontSize 14
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam roundcorner 8
skinparam ArrowColor #475569
skinparam rectangle {
  BorderColor #475569
  BackgroundColor #F8FAFC
}

rectangle "模型输出\nJSON text" as output #E0F2FE
rectangle "1. 解析\n完整 JSON / 大小 / 深度" as parse
rectangle "2. Schema\ntype / required / enum / format" as schema
rectangle "3. 归一化\ntimezone / unit / object identity" as normalize #FEF3C7
rectangle "4. 业务语义\n跨字段约束 / 权限 / 当前状态" as semantic
rectangle "5. 执行前绑定\nversion / idempotency / confirmation" as bind
rectangle "受控命令" as command #DCFCE7

output --> parse
parse --> schema
schema --> normalize
normalize --> semantic
semantic --> bind
bind --> command

note right of schema
  合法 JSON 只证明形状正确，
  不证明值指向正确对象或允许执行
end note
@enduml
